      "text": "Even and odd numbers are two complementary types of integers."
    },
    {
      "id": "definitions",
      "type": "heading-2",
      "text": "Even and odd numbers"
    },
    {
      "id": "definitions-body",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "An even integer is divisible by 2. An odd integer is not divisible by 2."
    },
    {
      "id": "representations",
      "type": "heading-2",
      "text": "Representing even and odd integers"
    },
    {
      "id": "representations-body",
      "type": "equation",
      "text": "x = 2a and y = 2b + 1, where a,b ∈ ℤ"
    },
